XSLT :  (Extensible Stylesheet Language Transformations)
--------------------------------------------------------

XSLT is a language used to transform XML documents into various formats. In the context of SAP CPI,
XSLT mapping allows you to: Transform Data: Convert XML data from the source format to the target
format using XSLT templates. This is particularly useful when you need to map data from one XML
structure to another.

